    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a701c221b5e24969ce7fd3d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>AI真能解决人类的情感困惑吗？曾经无数次看见小伙伴说，她们与AI聊自己的情感困惑，聊到后半夜。于是我们征集了几个小伙伴，聊了聊她们与AI的故事。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6013">01:40:13</a>指鹿为长：AI从业者聊「AI与感情」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48845">13:34:05</a>Tim：一本正经的“天马行空、脑洞大开”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122954">34:09:14</a>洵：一个机器竟然干了件“人事”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196092">54:28:12</a>水饺：AI它一点也不“唯物”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219871">61:04:31</a>Zoey：与四个大模型沟通感情困惑的“横向对比”</span><br><br><span>💜如果你也有类似的感受，或者想跟我们分享你的故事，欢迎留言，别忘了订阅我们的节目，点赞并分享给更多朋友！</span></p><p><span>💜如果想加入我们鳄鱼派对社区/播客和我们一起聊天，欢迎通过</span><a href="https://wj.qq.com/r/login.html?s_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwj.qq.com%2Fs2%2F16982316%2Fd6b9%2F&amp;sid=16982316&amp;hash=d6b9&amp;login_type=unite&amp;scene_type=respondent" data-url="https://wj.qq.com/r/login.html?s_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwj.qq.com%2Fs2%2F16982316%2Fd6b9%2F&amp;sid=16982316&amp;hash=d6b9&amp;login_type=unite&amp;scene_type=respondent"><span>报名渠道</span></a><span>加入上线社群/节目录制。</span></p>]]></description>
